WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Create and enter a clean release-candidate clone of WebHDP.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Copy .env.example to .env and generate local-only secrets without displaying them.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:22.000
Validate Docker Compose configuration and start the core stack with build.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:32.000
Check container status until backend and frontend are healthy.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Verify the frontend-served API health endpoint returns a successful response.
